      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:00:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:00 AM",
      "content": "John 3:16 is often heard and we believe it, but do we truly understand its power? It is the Gospel in a nutshell.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_13_002",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Pastor K. A. Shangle",
      "handle": "@KAShangle",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:05:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:05 AM",
      "content": "For God so loved the world, that He gave His only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in Him should not perish, but have everlasting life.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_13_003",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Pastor K. A. Shangle",
      "handle": "@KAShangle",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:15:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:15 AM",
      "content": "There is no more wonderful announcement in all the Word of God than what we read in this verse. Think of it, beloved! God is love.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_13_004",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Pastor K. A. Shangle",
      "handle": "@KAShangle",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:25:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:25 AM",
      "content": "To think that God could love a world that hated Him and demanded the death of His Son. He nailed Him to the cross and mocked Him while He died to redeem even those that hated Him.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_13_005",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Pastor K. A. Shangle",
      "handle": "@KAShangle",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:35:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:35 AM",
      "content": "That little word 'so' signifies that there are not enough words in all the languages of the world to explain the depth or the height of the great love God bestowed upon man.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_13_006",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Pastor K. A. Shangle",
      "handle": "@KAShangle",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T07:45:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:45 AM",
      "content": "The truth set forth in the Gospel is that God gave His Son to the world because He so loved the world that whosoever believeth in Him should not perish but have everlasting life.",
      "person_id": "p_421",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2013.pdf"
    },
